<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 250 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 250 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 100 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and</p>
<p>150 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Feb 19, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - May 21, 1997, Aug 20, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
